%!PS
% SPDX-FileCopyrightText: 2026 EfterScript contributors
% SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT
% expect-output: 5
% expect-output: (ok)
% expect-output: /unmatchedmark
% expect-output: (ok)
% expect-output: /rangecheck
% expect-output: /typecheck
% Scenario: the cache operators. ucachestatus leaves a mark and five
% integers; setucacheparams consumes everything down to the mark and
% is unmatchedmark without one; ucache outside a user path does
% nothing; setbbox outside a user path checks its operands (an
% inverted box is rangecheck, a string typecheck).
/try { stopped { $error /errorname get == } { (ok) == } ifelse } def
ucachestatus counttomark == cleartomark
{ mark 1000 setucacheparams } try
{ 1 2 setucacheparams } try
{ ucache 0 0 10 10 setbbox } try
{ 10 10 0 0 setbbox } try
{ 0 0 (a) 10 setbbox } try
